---
source: tui/src/chatwidget/workflow_monitor_tests.rs
expression: "format!(\"PENDING\\n{pending}\\n\\nAPPLIED\\n{applied}\\n\\nALREADY REQUESTED\\n{already_requested}\\n\\nFAILED\\n{failed}\\n\\nINACTIVE\\n{inactive}\")"
---
PENDING
› ◆ Workflow release-check  run-stop  running · elapsed ≥ 1s
  stop  requesting cancellation…
  ● work · elapsed ≥ 0s

  ↑↓ choose run/agent · Enter inspect agents · Esc exit

APPLIED
› ◆ Workflow release-check  run-stop  running · elapsed ≥ 1s
  stop  cancellation applied
  ● work · elapsed ≥ 0s

  ↑↓ choose run/agent · Enter inspect agents · Esc exit

ALREADY REQUESTED
› ◆ Workflow joined-stop  run-stop  running · elapsed ≥ 1s
  stop  workflow was already stopped
  ● work · elapsed ≥ 0s

  ↑↓ choose run/agent · Enter inspect agents · Esc exit

FAILED
› ◆ Workflow failed-stop  run-stop  running · elapsed ≥ 1s
  stop failed  remote cleanup failed
  ● work · elapsed ≥ 0s

  ↑↓ choose run/agent · x stop workflow · p pause · Enter inspect agents · Esc exit

INACTIVE
› ◆ Workflow inactive-stop  run-stop  interrupted · duration 8s
  ✓ work · duration 7s
  budget  12 / 100 weighted tokens

  ↑↓ choose run/agent · Enter inspect agents · Esc exit
